        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#cce5ff;strokeColor=#36393d;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; face=&quot;Tahoma&quot;&gt;firewalld: Allowed traffic by zone&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Public zone: SSH to Bastion, HTTPS to Web, DNS to Infra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Public zone: TCP port 22 closed on Web and Infra&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Administration zone: SSH, syslog, and NTP, restricted by source IP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;• Default zone: drop on all three servers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span&gt;• TCP port 3306 closed in all zones; MariaDB bound to 127.0.0.&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
